C as home to Fitness Center 2, a roller hockey rink, the Adventure Climbing Center, and space for several sports.","source_url":"https://recreation.ucsb.edu/facilities","source_title":"Facilities | UCSB Department of Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A valid Recreation Center membership is required; availability changes when sport clubs or intramural activities are scheduled.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
